@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam component {
 BackgroundColor #EAF0FF
 BorderColor #1749B5
}
top to bottom direction
title Context Map de Talki: colaboración principal entre contextos DDD
component "Gemini Live API" as gemini <<Proveedor externo>>
component "Live Coaching" as liveCoaching <<Bounded Context>>
component "Speech Analysis" as speechAnalysis <<Bounded Context>>
component "Scoring & Feedback" as scoring <<Bounded Context>>
component "Practice Session Management" as session <<Bounded Context>>
component "Progress & Adaptation" as progress <<Bounded Context>>
component "Sharing & Retention" as sharing <<Bounded Context>>
component "Gamification" as gamification <<Bounded Context>>
component "Identity & Access" as identity <<Bounded Context>>
component "AI Provider Gateway" as aiGateway <<Bounded Context>>
component "Notifications" as notifications <<Bounded Context>>
session --> liveCoaching : Sesión preparada y veredicto de\nvalidez (Customer/Supplier + PL)
liveCoaching --> session : Evidencia autorizada para cierre\n(Customer/Supplier)
session --> speechAnalysis : Sesión Finalizada desde outbox\n(Customer/Supplier + PL)
speechAnalysis --> scoring : Esquema versionado de métricas\n(Customer/Supplier + PL)
scoring --> progress : Evaluación completada:\nscoring.completed (Customer/Supplier +\nPL)
scoring --> sharing : Reportes publicados\n(Customer/Supplier)
liveCoaching --> aiGateway : Preparación de credencial efímera\n(Customer/Supplier)
aiGateway --> gemini : Contrato canónico traducido al\nproveedor (Anti-Corruption Layer)
scoring --> gamification : Evaluación completada:\nscoring.completed (Conformist)
sharing --> notifications : Acceso Revocado / Datos Purgados\n(Eventos publicados)
scoring --> notifications : Reporte Disponible: scoring.completed\n(Evento publicado)
gamification --> notifications : Logro Concedido: achievement.unlocked\n(Evento publicado)
note right of identity
OHS + Published Language para todos los contextos.
Cada consumidor valida claims y propiedad del recurso.
end note
legend bottom
Los componentes representan fronteras estratégicas de contexto.
Las flechas indican contratos entre contextos, no conexiones de despliegue.
Core: Live Coaching, Speech Analysis y Scoring. Supporting: Sessions, Progress, Sharing y Gamification.
Generic: Identity, AI Provider Gateway y Notifications.
El veredicto de validez de Sessions acompaña la evaluación consumida por Gamification.
La coordinación de purga se muestra en la figura de privacidad siguiente.
Privacidad, pasarela y nuevos canales incluyen capacidades propuestas.
endlegend
@enduml
